andate because they are already included within the figures on IDPs. In Rakhine State, the total number of stateless persons is estimated to be approximately one million. Revisions have been made to reduce the number of stateless persons due to departures to Bangladesh after October 2016. Outside of Rakhine State, the figure of those with undetermined nationality (25,939) is based on government data released on 27 December 2016 indicating the number of persons who hold an Identity Card for National Verification, whose citizenship has not yet been confirmed.","fn_e062962e":"The figures include an estimated 125,575 stateless IDPs, people in IDP-like situation who are also of concern under the statelessness mandate."},"raw_files":{"conflict.csv":{"label":"IDMC GIDD, conflict and violence (HDX csv)","header":["iso3","country_name","year","new_displacement","new_displacement_rounded","total_displacement","total_displacement_rounded"]},"persons_of_concern.csv":{"label":"UNHCR Refugee Data Finder download (persons_of_concern.csv)","header":["Year","Country of Asylum","Country of Origin","Country of Asylum ISO","Country of Origin ISO","Refugees","Asylum-seekers","IDPs","Other people in need of international protection","Stateless persons","Host community","Others of concern"]}},"raw_rows":{"conflict.csv#L144":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":144,"row":["MMR","Myanmar","2011","50000","50000","450000","450000"]},"conflict.csv#L204":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":204,"row":["MMR","Myanmar","2012","166000","166000","450000","450000"]},"conflict.csv#L263":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":263,"row":["MMR","Myanmar","2013","53946","54000","640900","641000"]},"conflict.csv#L31":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":31,"row":["MMR","Myanmar","2009","75000","75000","470000","470000"]},"conflict.csv#L322":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":322,"row":["MMR","Myanmar","2014","6200","6200","645261","645000"]},"conflict.csv#L381":{"file_key":"conflict.csv","line":381,"row":["MMR","Myanmar